# Server-side secrets for loaders, actions, and /api/* resource routes.
# Loaded by Node (`--env-file-if-exists=.env`) before the server starts, so
# read them with `process.env.NAME` inside the handler.
#
# Never give a secret a VITE_ prefix — those are inlined into the browser bundle.

# Optional: PocketBase Configuration (if using PocketBase backend)
# POCKETBASE_URL=http://localhost:8090
# PB_SUPERUSER_EMAIL=
# PB_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD=
